Package: rpi-vc4-edp
Version: 1.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: GamingTux <gamingtux@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/GamingTux/argon-oneup-suite
Depends: bash, xz-utils
Recommends: linux-headers-rpi-2712 | linux-headers-rpi-v8
Description: Automatic Kernel eDP Patcher for Raspberry Pi CM4 / CM5 Laptops
 Automatically builds and patches the vc4 DRM kernel module on every kernel
 upgrade to expose internal HDMI laptop panels as eDP-1. Enables native
 clamshell standby, instant wake, and desktop lid management. Auto-retires
 once upstream kernel PR #7732 is merged and released.
